Package: ggpclient
Title: Download, Label and Consolidate Data from the GGP Data Portal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jos", "Slabbekoorn", email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(note = "placeholder e-mail: set it before publishing"))
Description: Indexes the data portal of the Generations and Gender Programme (GGP), downloads and unpacks the
    GGS, FFS, Harmonized Histories and Additional Datasets, converts them to parquet with their variable and value
    labels, and stacks the countries of each round and wave into one dataset with harmonized labels. An R version
    of the Python package 'ggp_client': same steps, same folders, same files.
